<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-11-05T18:53:10.961Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 18:53:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces foiled a Hezbollah-linked bomb plot targeting the Homs oil refinery while Saudi Arabia and Syria signed a defence cooperation deal that includes $403 million in loans. A Lebanese border guard killed a Syrian woman and injured her child during an interception, and a landmine blast killed two soldiers in Daraa. Israeli airstrikes continued in southern Syria, and a cleric warned that Iran plans to disrupt oil supplies. The European Union expressed a security scare in Damascus and ISIS activity persisted after the U.S. withdrawal. 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE1PWDIyOGZIWE8wWDJYZkpWWlRpR0xPcXRub2lQd0pNaTFWWjlGY2t1VldFVGJFZS00dFNSMDlHR3FzZ1A4eUJCVjVxM1JsZHR4R1JYUkwxNnZTUWdqa0tN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1EekN4MmI1dDc3aF9nZS01bnlKYmpJUEpuZ1RrZkZUX01pTnNaeEtPTkVLVlBGVDdSbG92UXYxNVZmYzQ5akpmYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;L'Orient Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNM29OUHUzMDkzQTFQZFhjdGdKS1BPbFQtNUdUYjgxRUtjMjF5MWY0dVJBc1Z2dFViam9FZWhUZExuTG1ROEtBOGRibDFPZ1ZQYjd0VmNSTm41Y2xKbDk5c0h3RGV6RC0zcXpEV2JFZnNWTmRFX3RfNmlkODd1WDNsYm5oQTlBMWxhTlFDS3NFUDFsVmdmMDRmdHZyYnFHUkxBb2J1NTNMSFZ0eDFSWDlLekd3THpGS2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE5BZkFNam